    "title": "Principal Instructional Designer at Amity University Advisory Limited",
    "description": "An exciting career opportunity awaits you at Amity University Advisory Limited. We are on the lookout for a dedicated Instructional Designer to strengthen our Noida-based team.\n\nAbout Amity University Advisory Limited:\nAmity University Advisory Limited is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Design formative and summative assessments aligned to learning objectives\n• Maintain student records and prepare progress reports\n• Participate in school events, workshops, and training programs\n• Support students with special educational needs\n• Collaborate with faculty on curriculum development initiatives\n• Conduct doubt-clearing sessions and remedial classes for weak students\n• Monitor student progress and provide timely feedback\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Post Graduate Diploma in relevant field\n• 12-20 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Child Psychology\n• Proficiency in E-learning\n• Proficiency in Mentoring\n• Proficiency in Lesson Planning\n• Proficiency in Student Assessment\n• Proficiency in Special Education\n• Proficiency in Content Creation\n• Proficiency in Pedagogy\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Work-from-home flexibility\n• Recognition and rewards programs\n• Annual performance appraisal\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Learning & development budget\n• Salary Range: 35 LPA - 70 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Noida, Uttar Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Amity University Advisory Limited!",
